<title>USA: TABLE-Clayton Williams Q2 net income slips.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Clayton Williams Q2 net income slips.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Texas 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CLAYTON WILLIAMS ENERGY INC</p>
<p>				   3 Mos ended 6/30  6 Mos ended 6/30</p>
<p>			     1997    1996	     1997	 1996</p>
<p>REVENUES</p>
<p> Oil and gas sales $ 16,256$ 15,149	 $ 32,820   $ 27,517</p>
<p> Natural gas svcs	 837     985	    2,167	1,949</p>
<p> Total revenues	17,093  16,134	   34,987     29,466</p>
<p> NET INCOME	     1,187   2,439	    4,418	3,843</p>
<p> Net EPS		    .13     .32		.49	  .51</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs(000s)  9,079   7,627	    9,096	7,553</p>
<p>		  (Dollars in thousands, except per unit data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Discretionary cash flow (net income before exploration costs, depreciation, depletion and amortization and impairments) increased to $11.2 million in 1997 from $9.8 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Company said the decrease in net income was due primarily to higher exploration costs, offset in part by higher oil and gas sales. Q2 1997 includes $2.4 million of exploration costs.</p>
</text>
